      "_note": "The neck coils back into the shell and fires - the classic snapping-turtle bite. Translation stays on Rump, the skeleton root. The lunge distance is large because attack_reach measures the head against the BIND front, and this neck already sits fully extended at rest: rotation alone barely gains ground, so the body has to travel.",
